("Measurement completeness: a classifier trained with all explicit religious words masked (cross-validated area under the ROC curve 0.92) ranked the 122,611 unflagged descriptions. The LLM coder found 0 religious descriptions among 117 sampled from the top 2,000, 3 among 240 further down, and 11 among 77 implicit-phrase matches (\"godsend\", \"karma\", \"higher power\").",
 "Measurement completeness: a classifier trained with all explicit religious words masked (cross-validated area under the ROC curve 0.92) ranked the 122,611 unflagged descriptions. Because the masked classifier learns the gratitude and hardship style that accompanies religious language rather than religion itself, the ranking is a weak detector. The LLM coder read a stratified sample of it: 59 of the top 500 (0 religious), 58 of ranks 500–2,000 (0), 240 of ranks 2,000–10,000 (3) and 99 below rank 10,000 (0). Extrapolating the 2,000–10,000 stratum gives about 100 missed descriptions, and the sample below rank 10,000 bounds the miss rate there only at about 3 percent, so the upper bound is wide. A second search for implicit phrases (\"godsend\", \"karma\", \"higher power\") coded 11 of 77 matches as religious. Any missed religious descriptions sit in the comparison group and attenuate the H2 estimate toward zero."),
